{
  "project": "corpus/kaia-yield",
  "annotated_by": "manual reading of CooldownVault.sol, BaseCooldownStrategy.sol, CustomYearnStrategy.sol, BaseStrategy.sol (vendored Yearn), CustomVault.sol and CustomStrategy.sol at ddbfd27 plus the upstream README (AssetLens authors)",
  "annotated_at": "2026-10-20, before the first analyzer or LLM run on this project",
  "notes": [
    "Kaia local-yield path only: CooldownVault -> (Yearn V2 vault, Vyper, not in the repository) -> CustomYearnStrategy -> CustomVault -> CustomStrategy. The cross-chain OriginVault/RemoteVault path and the router are out of scope.",
    "Kinds list every acceptable label; callers use the role vocabulary below. Positions are holder:asset.",
    "CooldownVault shares can only be held by addresses in _authorizedAddresses (_beforeTokenTransfer checks both sides), hence the 'authorized' holder class.",
    "withdraw/redeem burn shares and create a RedeemRequest owned by 'receiver'; claim(requestId) pays the stored receiver. With cooldownPeriod == 0 the claim happens inside withdraw/redeem.",
    "predeposit mints CooldownVault shares to a registered strategy against a debt (strategyDebtOutstanding / predepositRequests); retrieveDebt makes the strategy repay underlying to the CooldownVault.",
    "Deployment facts used for the configuration (DEPLOYED_CONTRACTS.md / constructors): the Yearn vault's token is the CooldownVault; CustomYearnStrategy.customVault and externalShareToken are the CustomVault; CustomVault registers CustomStrategy, whose remoteVault is the CustomVault.",
    "Annotated by the tool authors: an independent annotation is needed before reporting numbers in a paper."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "roles": {
      "any": "any account",
      "authorized": "member of CooldownVault._authorizedAddresses (router, Yearn vault, strategies)",
      "request_receiver": "receiver stored in the redeem request",
      "request_strategy": "strategy stored in the predeposit request",
      "cv_strategy": "member of CooldownVault._strategiesSet (registered strategy)",
      "cv_keepers": "CooldownVault management/governance or the strategy's keeper()/strategist() (strategy must be registered)",
